{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_st04",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_st04",
  "title": "海浪照常拍岸",
  "storyCode": "DH-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c621533f0a88c7ff8b90f6c9967ed1cc8de0087f1d7723fd3cd77d38ec6bae6d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "你终于醒了，D.D.D.。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "怎么了，睡完觉醒过来不是很正常的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "但你昨天回来之后倒头就睡，搞得我有点害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "......现在外面是什么情况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "如果你是问城里的状况的话，和之前没什么差别，一样的喧闹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "我去吃早饭的时候听到很多人在讨论昨天的事，但是他们也都不怎么在乎的感觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "毕竟事情已经被冲淡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "坎黛拉市长真是个厉害人物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "在昨天那种情况下，居然会用那样的方式......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "我当时在电视前也震惊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "那种镇场的方式，真的是闻所未闻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "而且还真的有不少人去和那些危险分子战斗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "我当时就在旁边，那种感觉，真是太奇妙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士的不远处，是想要拼命冲过来杀掉她的危险分子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "而坎黛拉女士对此却不屑一顾，她只关心无人机有没有靠近游轮，能否看到船上的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "她就站在那里，对着屏幕和海面指指点点，一边和旁边的人说笑着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "在那一刻，正在发生的一切仿佛都是不真实的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "最后，那两位女侠出现了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "她们的出现又将一切拉回了现实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "这真是......这真是太刺激了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "所以你想创作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "啊哈哈，不愧是你，真了解我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "text": "你以为我们认识了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "是的，我要创作，我要将此时此刻的害怕、感激、迷茫都记录下来，作成一首歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "text": "这首歌为我自己而作，但与她们有关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "这座城市虽然还挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "莱塔尼亚的歌剧，哥伦比亚的电影，还有玻利瓦尔的咖啡，之前想要体验的东西都体验到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "不过，这座城市里的人还真是无聊，比赛过半就不想跟他们玩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "要是早知道最后会变成这样，中途确认陈姐姐没事后应该和她一起上船的，这样应该能多帮上她的忙吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "算啦，反正这座城市也差不多玩腻了，看一看陈姐姐她们会去哪里吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "text": "陈姐姐来的地方，肯定也有许多和陈姐姐一样的好人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你太乱来了，诗怀雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯，哦哦哦，好好好，知道了知道了，为什么我非得被你教训不可！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "现在近卫局可以说就是交在你的手里，你却......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "哎呀，我自己有数的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "你才是，明明是跑罗德岛当干员，结果却偷偷跑这里来度假！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我这是......算了，你说得也没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "接着吵啊，怎么停了，老陈走了之后，你们上次吵架感觉都不知道是什么时候的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "我上次去罗德岛的时候还是吵过的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎呀，总之，来都来了，事情也都解决了，我们还是把一些不愉快给忘掉，然后好好地玩一玩才是正经。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "对吧，老陈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "哈......也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎么了，还在想昨天的事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "是。呵，这可能是我这辈子收到的最不想要的荣誉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，确实，老实说，就算是我，也觉得够膈应人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但是它就是发生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陈，世上可没有那么多两全其美和称心如意的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "行了行了，比起坐着聊天，不如出去购物吃大餐才能提起精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "走了，中午本小姐请客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "那只死老鼠去哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "她好像一大早就出去了，但是不知道去哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我大概知道，我去找她吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "找到了记得告诉我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "哼，昨晚开始就躲着我，等我找到她，她死定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我离开后，这里就交给你打理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "教给你的那些没忘吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "当然，您放一百个心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们在聊什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "啊，是陈小姐，大姐头正在给我们训话呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "别跟她扯这个，小心她逮捕你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我已经不是警察了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我可没见过你这么多管闲事的游客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "先下去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "找我有什么事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我想，你应该不会是主动找我来喝酒的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "如果我说是呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那......喝一杯也可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我知道的龙门青年创业者协会会长，是个雷厉风行，对自己和他人都很严格的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这一次，算是见识到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "而我知道的龙门近卫局特别督察组组长，是个铁面无私，对罪犯毫不留情的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "这一次，也算是领教了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这次是魏彦吾让你来的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "是文月夫人让我代表魏长官来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我一开始不理解，看到你就理解了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......你不生气？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不生气，这对我而言是个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "鼠王的女儿未必是鼠王，但也可以是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "所以你才帮他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......我不会告诉你答案的，陈晖洁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "因为我和你不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你想说我抛弃了龙门。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "一开始是有点这个意思，现在没有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "这只是陈述句，我和你不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "听着还是刺耳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那是你的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "喂，你找到死老鼠没有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "她就在旁边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "你们现在在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "26号沿海公路的一家酒吧里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "26号？那正好，我看到有家很不错的店也在那里，我把地址发给你，你们先过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "给我把那只死老鼠也拖上，她别想跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你也听到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......唉，这个女人还是这么麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "沙滩那边的人真多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "毕竟这座城市的象征之一，那艘游轮就那么沉了，总会有许多人好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "那艘游轮......呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不管你怎么想，那艘游轮是我们炸掉的，这是事实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士同意用我们的奖金来抵消已经是谢天谢地了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "确切地说，是你炸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你有更好的方法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "嗯？那边的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "埃内斯托？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "陈小姐，林小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你怎么在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士饶了父亲以外的其他人一命，大部分人都被放逐了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士念在我这几年的功劳上，允许我留下，当然，我的工作肯定是没了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你打算留下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "不，我打算离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "我和拉菲艾拉在犹豫去哪里，我从昨晚想到现在也想不出一个所以然，就在这里看着海发呆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "拉菲艾拉是那个小姑娘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "是的，她是父亲战友皮尤的女儿，皮尤叔叔为了把父亲从监狱里救出来而死，死前把她托付给了父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "两位有没有考虑过现在把我就地解决掉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我还没有资格来审判你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "如果你成功了，再让我遇到你，我会杀了你。现在......就算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "哈哈，真是有两位风格的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "......陈小姐，林小姐，用炎国的话来说，我这样已经是大不孝了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "虽然也有大义灭亲的说法，不过你算不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "哈哈哈，确实，我可没有什么大义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "不过至少，在这一次行动的过程中，我没有想过背叛父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "我在船上对陈小姐你说的那些话，并不是谎言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "我不知道两位这段时间在这里生活有没有这样的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "我清楚地知道这座城市建立在什么之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "但是，当我看到这些高楼大厦，这片碧波蓝天的时候，我还是会不由自主地觉得它是对的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "我想不出除此以外的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......但你选择离开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "老实说，其实如果不是两位的出现，我觉得我一定会从此甘愿成为坎黛拉女士的手下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "但是，陈小姐你对我说的那些话，又让我产生了迷茫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "两位来自其他国家，说不定，在其他地方，有不同的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "......呼，和两位说完之后，感觉舒服了一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "感谢两位没有见面就把我解决掉，还听我说了这么多废话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "立场不同而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "我就不继续打扰两位了，我应该还会在这座城市停留一段时间，要是有用得到我的地方，请尽管找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......我帮不了他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我也......你的意思是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我只是觉得让他就这么下去有些可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我会考虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "喂，老陈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我们正好从市政府出来，诗小姐把我们也一起叫上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "原来如此。和市长谈得如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "沾了你们的光，我们也算是对这次事件有贡献，市长想都没想就同意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "确实是有那位的风格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "死老鼠，终于让我抓到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我又没跑。反倒是你，你是不是脑子有病，诗怀雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "你才脑子有病！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "一般人会因为嫉妒朋友出去玩而自己也跟上，而且到了地方还躲着对方的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "本小姐乐意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "对了，Missy说下午要一起去购物，顺便买土特产，老陈，林小姐，饭后一起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "死老鼠不准不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "好吧，反正我也没什么特别的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "那我们先去吃饭吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "四位，来，稍微摆一下pose。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我忽然觉得这一幕很适合拍成照片，我来给你们拍一张，作为这次度假的纪念吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "好啊好啊，喂，死老鼠，要拍照了，赶紧站好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......唉，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，我们四个聚在一起倒也确实是难得的机会，那就拍一张吧，老陈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那么，三，二，一，茄子——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你在看雨霞写的有关这次多索雷斯之行的报告？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "对。许久没有见到坎黛拉，这个女人看来还是老样子，疯疯癫癫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你敢说你和她不一样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "我和她当然不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "我听派去的信使说，雨霞和小陈，这次好像做得很不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "虽然不知道为什么诗怀雅家大小姐和星熊也去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "她们两个确实做得很不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "但我想，她们自己不会很高兴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "你说坎黛拉不会害她们，我同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "但坎黛拉这个女人的善意，我恐怕她们还不知道该怎么去承受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "对这个女人来说，没有大是大非，只有结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "所以你还是拐弯抹角想说我一开始不该送小陈和雨霞过去是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "不，恰好相反，你说得对，见一见，没有坏处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哎哟，难得你也会说些好话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "既然这样，给你看个好东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "雨霞带回来的一张照片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "看，年轻真好，一个个都有活力得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "我们也有过那样的时光，你还记得吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "我当然记得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "看到小陈过得好，我也就放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "这张照片我要去裱起来，好好收藏起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "你高兴就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "彦吾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你说，小陈还会回来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "她会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
